       as live `kind` values), misstating the default value of `kind`, or omitting
       the on-demand-only / not-on-boot guidance. Agents read this description at
       tool-discovery time and form the call-site mental model from it; teaching
       the wrong contract there silently re-introduces the connector-dispatch
       temptation the schema collapse retired, regardless of how correct the
